<section class="section flow">
  <h2>How the Society works</h2>

  <p>The Society holds a brief Annual General Meeting in September or October each year, where all members present elect the Officers and a Committee. The Committee meets regularly throughout the year to carry out the Society's objectives.</p>

  <h2>Our objectives</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Promote civic pride in Wiveliscombe.</li>
    <li>Promote high standards of planning and architecture.</li>
    <li>Raise public awareness of the history, geography and natural history of the town.</li>
    <li>Preserve, protect, develop and improve those features unique to Wiveliscombe.</li>
    <li>Secure and promote the economic welfare of Wiveliscombe.</li>
    <li>Bring together the people of Wiveliscombe at meetings, social gatherings and events.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

